<title>USA: TABLE-Zebra Technologies Corp Q2 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Zebra Technologies Corp Q2 net up.</headline>
<dateline>VERNON HILLS, Ill. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.30		    $0.26</p>
<p> Net			  7,281		    6,260</p>
<p> Revs			47,844		   38,920</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  24,244		   24,198</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.76		    $0.48</p>
<p> Net			 18,516		   11,509</p>
<p> Revs			88,853		   75,446</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  24,242		   24,194</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q2 net includes one-time charge on discontinuation of retail software business of $2.36 million, or $0.10 a share. Included as charges for discontinued operations were $2.65 million in 1997 6-months net; $522,000 in 1996 Q2 net; and $981,000 in 1996 6-months net.</p>
